      "chat": {
        "lineCount": 10337,
        "sha256": "380a04abc665f34bd32091339c233c477dd53196a49083e0e5c2395bce6ab88d",
        "raw": {
          "lineCount": 10337,
          "sha256": "e1b400afb3c175ca2b1ae584b60045c193d25a095b7609e4612a56a735842c6b",
          "head": [
            "",
            "\u001b[38;5;69m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m",
            " \u001b[1m\u001b[38;5;109mWhat's New\u001b[39m\u001b[22m                                                                                         ",
            "",
            "                                                                                                    ",
            " \u001b[38;5;111m\u001b[1m[0.10.0] - 2025-11-25\u001b[22m\u001b[39m                                                                              ",
            "                                                                                                    ",
            " Initial public release.                                                                            ",
            "                                                                                                    ",
            " \u001b[38;5;111m\u001b[1m### \u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;111m\u001b[1mAdded\u001b[22m\u001b[39m                                                                                          ",
            "                                                                                                    ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39mInteractive TUI with streaming responses                                                         ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39mConversation session management with \u001b[38;5;109m--continue\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;5;109m--resume\u001b[39m, and \u001b[38;5;109m--session\u001b[39m flags                   ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39mMulti-line input support (Shift+Enter or Option+Enter for new lines)                             ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39mTool execution: \u001b[38;5;109mread\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;5;109mwrite\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;5;109medit\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;5;109mbash\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;5;109mglob\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;5;109mgrep\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;5;109mthink\u001b[39m                                       ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39mThinking mode support for Claude with visual indicator and \u001b[38;5;109m/thinking\u001b[39m selector                    ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39mFile path autocompletion with \u001b[38;5;109m@\u001b[39m prefix                                                           ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39mSlash command autocompletion                                                                     ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;109m/export\u001b[39m command for HTML session export                                                          ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;109m/model\u001b[39m command for runtime model switching                                                       "
          ],
          "tail": [
            "   \u001b_orb:w \u0007\u001b[38;5;241m(https://github.com/wutongyuonce)\u001b[39m).                                                              ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39mFixed inherited skill slash-command autocomplete ranking the \u001b[38;5;109mskill:\u001b[39m prefix instead of the bare   ",
            "   \u001b_orb:w \u0007skill name (\u001b[38;5;109m\u001b[4m#9120\u001b[24m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;241m (https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/pull/9120)\u001b[39m by \u001b[38;5;109m\u001b[4m@yearth\u001b[24m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;241m                    ",
            "   \u001b_orb:w \u0007\u001b[38;5;241m(https://github.com/yearth)\u001b[39m).                                                                    ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39mFixed inherited file autocomplete boundaries and path quoting around CJK punctuation (\u001b[38;5;109m\u001b[4m#9746\u001b[24m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;241m      ",
            "   \u001b_orb:w \u0007\u001b[38;5;241m(https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/pull/9746)\u001b[39m by \u001b[38;5;109m\u001b[4m@haoqixu\u001b[24m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;241m (https://github.com/haoqixu)\u001b[39m).      ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39mFixed inherited LaTeX legacy font switches falling back to raw source, centered \u001b[38;5;109mcases\u001b[39m layouts    ",
            "   \u001b_orb:w \u0007around surrounding equations, and vertically laid out unsupported and nested display scripts     ",
            "   \u001b_orb:w \u0007(\u001b[38;5;109m\u001b[4m#8827\u001b[24m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;241m (https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/issues/8827)\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;5;109m\u001b[4m#9564\u001b[24m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;241m                                 ",
            "   \u001b_orb:w \u0007\u001b[38;5;241m(https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/issues/9564)\u001b[39m, \u001b[38;5;109m\u001b[4m#7929\u001b[24m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;241m                                        ",
            "   \u001b_orb:w \u0007\u001b[38;5;241m(https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/issues/7929)\u001b[39m).                                             ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39mFixed inherited fullscreen Kitty images being erased by later row clears in WezTerm (\u001b[38;5;109m\u001b[4m#9169\u001b[24m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;241m       ",
            "   \u001b_orb:w \u0007\u001b[38;5;241m(https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/issues/9169)\u001b[39m).                                             ",
            "                                                                                                    ",
            " \u001b[38;5;111m\u001b[1m### \u001b[22m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;111m\u001b[1mRemoved\u001b[22m\u001b[39m                                                                                        ",
            "                                                                                                    ",
            " \u001b[38;5;109m- \u001b[39mRemoved unavailable inherited GPT-5.4 and GPT-5.4 mini models from OpenAI Codex selection (\u001b[38;5;109m\u001b[4m#9394\u001b[24m ",
            "   \u001b_orb:w \u0007\u001b[4;38;5;109m\u001b[24m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;241m (https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/issues/9394)\u001b[39m).                                            ",
            "                                                                                                    ",
            "\u001b[38;5;69m────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────\u001b[39m"
          ]
        },
        "head": [
          "",
          "────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────",
          " What's New",
          "",
          "",
          " [0.10.0] - 2025-11-25",
          "",
          " Initial public release.",
          "",
          " ### Added",
          "",
          " - Interactive TUI with streaming responses",
          " - Conversation session management with --continue, --resume, and --session flags",
          " - Multi-line input support (Shift+Enter or Option+Enter for new lines)",
          " - Tool execution: read, write, edit, bash, glob, grep, think",
          " - Thinking mode support for Claude with visual indicator and /thinking selector",
          " - File path autocompletion with @ prefix",
          " - Slash command autocompletion",
          " - /export command for HTML session export",
          " - /model command for runtime model switching"
        ],
        "tail": [
          "   \u001b_orb:w \u0007(https://github.com/wutongyuonce)).",
          " - Fixed inherited skill slash-command autocomplete ranking the skill: prefix instead of the bare",
          "   \u001b_orb:w \u0007skill name (#9120 (https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/pull/9120) by @yearth",
          "   \u001b_orb:w \u0007(https://github.com/yearth)).",
          " - Fixed inherited file autocomplete boundaries and path quoting around CJK punctuation (#9746",
          "   \u001b_orb:w \u0007(https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/pull/9746) by @haoqixu (https://github.com/haoqixu)).",
          " - Fixed inherited LaTeX legacy font switches falling back to raw source, centered cases layouts",
          "   \u001b_orb:w \u0007around surrounding equations, and vertically laid out unsupported and nested display scripts",
          "   \u001b_orb:w \u0007(#8827 (https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/issues/8827), #9564",
          "   \u001b_orb:w \u0007(https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/issues/9564), #7929",
          "   \u001b_orb:w \u0007(https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/issues/7929)).",
          " - Fixed inherited fullscreen Kitty images being erased by later row clears in WezTerm (#9169",
          "   \u001b_orb:w \u0007(https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/issues/9169)).",
          "",
          " ### Removed",
          "",
          " - Removed unavailable inherited GPT-5.4 and GPT-5.4 mini models from OpenAI Codex selection (#9394",
          "   \u001b_orb:w \u0007 (https://github.com/earendil-works/pi/issues/9394)).",
          "",
          "────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────"
        ]
      }
